<title>@ViewData["Title"] Tooth Filling</title>

@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
    ViewData["FullWidthLayout"] = true;
}

<div class="Teeth-Filling-hero">
    <div class="overlay text-center">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Tooth Filling</h1>
        <p class="lead">Cavities and tooth decay are among the most common dental issues — but they’re also some of the easiest to treat. 
            At DenTeeth, our tooth filling services are designed to restore the strength, shape, and appearance of damaged teeth while preventing further decay.</p>
        <p class="lead">Our fillings are made from high-quality, durable materials such as composite resin, ceramic, or amalgam, depending on your needs and preferences. 
            Whether it’s a small cavity or a larger area of decay, we carefully remove the affected portion of the tooth and fill it with a biocompatible material that blends naturally with your smile.</p>
        <p class="lead">Tooth fillings not only repair the damage but also help maintain proper bite alignment and prevent infection or tooth loss. 
            The procedure is quick, virtually painless, and performed under local anesthesia to ensure your comfort throughout the process.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <a href="/Appointment/Appointment?service=Tooth Fillings" class="btn btn-outline-light px-4">Make Appointment</a>
            <a href="/Home/Index/#Our_Service" class="btn btn-dark px-4">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
